@abstract:
Physical State contract for Neurophone. Hard invariants that MUST hold
at all times — checked by the estate K9 runner and CI.
@end

@requires:
- section: Core-Files
- section: License
- section: Banned
- section: Proofs
- section: Security
@end

## Core-Files

### license-present
- description: LICENSE file must exist
- run: test -f LICENSE
- severity: critical

### readme-present
- description: README must exist
- run: test -f README.adoc || test -f README.md
- severity: critical

### explainme-present
- description: EXPLAINME (show-me-the-receipts) file must exist
- run: test -f EXPLAINME.adoc || test -f EXPLAINME.md
- severity: critical

### state-a2ml-present
- description: Machine-readable state checkpoint must exist
- run: test -f .machine_readable/6a2/STATE.a2ml
- severity: critical

### cargo-workspace-present
- description: Cargo workspace must exist
- run: test -f Cargo.toml && grep -q '\[workspace\]' Cargo.toml
- severity: critical

## License

### spdx-header-in-rs-files
- description: All Rust source files must have an SPDX-License-Identifier header
- run: "! find crates -name '*.rs' -not -path '*/target/*' | xargs grep -rL 'SPDX-License-Identifier' 2>/dev/null | grep -v '^$' | head -1 | grep ."
- severity: critical

### license-is-mpl2
- description: LICENSE file must contain MPL-2.0
- run: grep -q 'Mozilla Public License' LICENSE || grep -q 'MPL' LICENSE
- severity: critical

### no-pmpl-in-cargo
- description: Cargo.toml must not declare PMPL licence
- run: "! grep -q 'PMPL' Cargo.toml"
- severity: critical

## Banned

### no-hardcoded-paths
- description: No hardcoded developer paths
- run: "! grep -rn '/home/hyper\|/mnt/eclipse' --include='*.rs' --include='*.sh' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v '.git/' | head -1 | grep ."
- severity: critical

### no-dockerfiles
- description: No Dockerfiles (use Containerfile)
- run: test ! -f Dockerfile
- severity: warning

### no-makefiles
- description: No Makefiles (use Justfile)
- run: test ! -f Makefile
- severity: warning

### no-typescript
- description: No TypeScript files (use AffineScript)
- run: "! find . -name '*.ts' -not -name '*.d.ts' -not -path '*/.git/*' -not -path '*/target/*' 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep ."
- severity: critical

### no-secrets-committed
- description: No .env or credential files in repo
- run: test ! -f .env && test ! -f credentials.json && test ! -f .env.local
- severity: critical

## Proofs

### proof-tracker-present
- description: Proof obligation tracker must exist
- run: test -f proofs/README.adoc
- severity: warning

### proof-lifecycle-present
- description: TLA+ lifecycle spec must exist
- run: test -f proofs/tla/Lifecycle.tla
- severity: warning

### proof-affine-spec-present
- description: AffineScript affine-resource design spec must exist (obligation 2.3)
- run: test -f proofs/affine/README.adoc
- severity: warning

## Security

### hypatia-baseline-present
- description: Hypatia baseline exemption file must exist (android/** carve-out)
- run: test -f .hypatia-baseline.json
- severity: warning

### no-http-urls-in-source
- description: No insecure HTTP URLs in Rust source
- run: "! grep -rn 'http://' --include='*.rs' . 2>/dev/null | grep -v '.git/' | grep -v '// ' | head -1 | grep ."
- severity: warning

### cargo-lock-committed
- description: Cargo.lock must be committed (reproducible builds)
- run: test -f Cargo.lock
- severity: critical
